00:44:06,791 --> 00:44:09,000
Mash Ghasem… you know that… - Bismillah-ir-Rahman-ir-Rahim.

1076
00:44:09,041 --> 00:44:09,791
That…

1077
00:44:10,250 --> 00:44:12,958
You probably want to know where Lady Leili is sitting?

1078
00:44:16,083 --> 00:44:20,208
Be careful! Don’t let him speak under any circumstances! (They speak quietly)

1079
00:44:20,250 --> 00:44:22,666
Rest assured.

1080
00:44:22,708 --> 00:44:23,625
Yes, sir.

1081
00:44:28,750 --> 00:44:30,125
Read louder.

1082
00:44:30,291 --> 00:44:33,333
During the recitation of God’s word, you must not let,

1083
00:44:33,375 --> 00:44:35,750
Any human voice be heard!

1084
00:44:41,416 --> 00:44:42,375
Enjoy it, kid… - Saeid!

1085
00:44:45,375 --> 00:44:46,291
Go sit next to your Agha Joon.

1086
00:44:46,333 --> 00:44:46,833
Go get lost!

1087
00:45:09,125 --> 00:45:09,750
Asdollah!

1088
00:45:10,125 --> 00:45:10,750
Shazdeh!

1089
00:45:11,541 --> 00:45:12,125
Shazdeh!

1090
00:45:14,416 --> 00:45:16,291
How are you, Prince Asdollah?

1091
00:45:19,916 --> 00:45:20,625
I can’t hear!

1092
00:45:23,125 --> 00:45:25,041
I was talking to you and your brother.

1093
00:45:26,875 --> 00:45:28,166
Honestly, I can’t hear!

1094
00:45:28,166 --> 00:45:29,250
I’ll see you later.

1095
00:45:29,875 --> 00:45:31,000
Just… - Eh Sir, sit down!

1096
00:45:31,041 --> 00:45:32,458
At a mourning ceremony,

1097
00:45:32,458 --> 00:45:34,083
They don’t make this much noise!

1098
00:45:36,583 --> 00:45:38,583
How inconsiderate people have become!

1099
00:45:49,791 --> 00:45:51,250
Married five years,

1100
00:45:51,250 --> 00:45:52,166
Has six kids!

1101
00:46:00,041 --> 00:46:02,208
Still just wants to keep having kids!

1102
00:46:03,083 --> 00:46:03,958
You’re right!

1103
00:46:05,625 --> 00:46:07,041
Cover your child’s face.

1104
00:46:12,125 --> 00:46:13,791
Agha Joon, are you looking for someone?

1105
00:46:13,833 --> 00:46:14,708
Dustali-Khan!

1106
00:46:14,750 --> 00:46:16,708
I haven’t seen him either, seems he hasn’t come yet.

1107
00:46:16,750 --> 00:46:17,333
Look!

1108
00:46:17,333 --> 00:46:18,958
Go to the women’s section,

1109
00:46:18,958 --> 00:46:20,458
If Lady Aziz has come,

1110
00:46:20,458 --> 00:46:22,291
Tell her to come behind the curtain, I need to talk to her.

1111
00:46:22,708 --> 00:46:24,583
Say my dad has something to tell her. Run!

1112
00:46:25,000 --> 00:46:25,750
Run!

1113
00:46:31,833 --> 00:46:33,541
I want to go to the women’s section…

1114
00:46:52,500 --> 00:46:53,416
Shaajoon!

1115
00:46:53,416 --> 00:46:54,250
Thank you so much.

1116
00:46:54,291 --> 00:46:54,916
Shaajoon!

1117
00:46:56,583 --> 00:46:57,125
Go!

1118
00:46:57,541 --> 00:46:58,166
Get out!

1119
00:47:06,583 --> 00:47:07,750
Let me see!

1120
00:47:08,250 --> 00:47:09,041
Where!

1121
00:47:09,416 --> 00:47:10,541
I have business!

1122
00:47:10,583 --> 00:47:11,333
In there!

1123
00:47:11,375 --> 00:47:12,791
What business do you have in the women’s section?

1124
00:47:13,166 --> 00:47:14,500
You big shameless bastard!

1125
00:47:14,541 --> 00:47:15,083
Go!

1126
00:47:15,666 --> 00:47:17,000
You big oaf of a boy… run!

1127
00:47:23,750 --> 00:47:24,958
What is it? What do you want?

1128
00:47:25,750 --> 00:47:26,291
Why did you come here?

1129
00:47:26,333 --> 00:47:28,041
Hasn’t Lady Aziz-Saltaneh come?

1130
00:47:30,083 --> 00:47:31,250
No, not yet!

1131
00:47:32,333 --> 00:47:33,125
What do you want with her?

1132
00:47:33,166 --> 00:47:34,416
Agha Joon needs her.

1133
00:47:34,416 --> 00:47:35,208
Tell him she’s not here!

1134
00:47:36,875 --> 00:47:38,208
Shameless, what are you doing here?

1135
00:47:38,208 --> 00:47:39,708
Go to the men’s section!

1136
00:47:41,333 --> 00:47:42,916
Hey kid, go sit down!

1137
00:47:42,958 --> 00:47:45,000
Why are you crawling around the ladies’ feet!

1138
00:47:45,041 --> 00:47:47,166
Asdollah, enough already!

1139
00:47:50,583 --> 00:47:51,791
It’s disgraceful!

1140
00:47:53,875 --> 00:47:56,583
Brother Khan, why are you telling me it’s disgraceful?

1141
00:47:57,291 --> 00:47:59,250
Tahereh Khanom is looking at you!

1142
00:47:59,666 --> 00:48:00,458
Me!

1143
00:48:00,750 --> 00:48:02,708
A… a… at me! Moment… Moment—

1144
00:48:02,708 --> 00:48:04,291
Shir-Ali the butcher’s wife!

1145
00:48:05,333 --> 00:48:07,500
The same guy who’s two and a half meters tall?

1146
00:48:07,500 --> 00:48:08,250
Yes!

1147
00:48:09,250 --> 00:48:10,208
A few years ago,

1148
00:48:10,291 --> 00:48:13,625
He cut off his wife’s lover’s head with a cleaver.

1149
00:48:13,833 --> 00:48:15,416
So now he’s in prison?

1150
00:48:15,458 --> 00:48:16,000
No!

1151
00:48:16,958 --> 00:48:18,250
Later it turned out,

1152
00:48:18,250 --> 00:48:19,708
His wife had run off with the guy to San Francisco,

1153
00:48:19,750 --> 00:48:20,958
He only served six months,

1154
00:48:20,958 --> 00:48:22,041
Then they released him!

1155
00:48:32,250 --> 00:48:35,916
Hey Seyed Abolghasem, get up and shut this vile man’s mouth!

1156
00:48:36,541 --> 00:48:38,375
Rest assured!

1157
00:48:49,000 --> 00:48:50,083
Ya Allah!

1158
00:49:00,916 --> 00:49:05,708
I seek refuge with Allah from Satan the accursed and stoned!

1159
00:49:08,541 --> 00:49:11,000
In the name of Allah, the Most Gracious, the Most Merciful.

1160
00:49:12,916 --> 00:49:18,083
Blessings and peace be upon the noblest of all His creation.

1161
00:49:20,375 --> 00:49:21,500
Where is Shir-Ali?

1162
00:49:21,541 --> 00:49:24,416
And the Seal of the Prophets—

1163
00:49:24,416 --> 00:49:25,291
He went to the Shabdol-Azim shrine.

1164
00:49:27,125 --> 00:49:29,833
Abul-Qasem Mohammad…

1165
00:49:29,875 --> 00:49:37,375
O Allah, send blessings upon Mohammad and the family of Mohammad.

1166
00:49:38,791 --> 00:49:44,708
From the cruelty of fate and the turning of time, Muslim.

1167
00:49:45,458 --> 00:49:51,291
Remained in Kufa, how bewildered and lost, Muslim.

1168
00:49:51,333 --> 00:49:52,666
Agha Joon! Lady Aziz-Saltaneh still hasn’t come.

1169
00:49:52,875 --> 00:49:56,750
You missed it last night… - With weary body, parched lips and…

1170
00:49:58,375 --> 00:50:00,291
Agha Joon, focus on the mourning!

1171
00:50:00,291 --> 00:50:01,541
It is a holy night.

1172
00:50:04,416 --> 00:50:06,791
With weary body, parched lips and…

1173
00:50:06,791 --> 00:50:09,208
A funny thing happened here. - Wounded and afflicted state

1174
00:50:09,208 --> 00:50:10,250
I can’t hear!

1175
00:50:10,291 --> 00:50:11,666
Agha Joon, focus on the mourning!

1176
00:50:12,708 --> 00:50:14,166
It is a holy night!

1177
00:50:17,250 --> 00:50:23,000
Unwillingly wandered, fell captive to the accursed, Muslim.

1178
00:50:24,041 --> 00:50:25,916
You’re right, it’s hard to hear… I’ll come over now. - From sorrow of separation and…

1179
00:50:25,958 --> 00:50:27,916
- And the exile of child and…

1180
00:50:27,916 --> 00:50:28,583
Last night,

1181
00:50:28,583 --> 00:50:30,625
It was almost midnight when… - Wife.

1182
00:50:30,666 --> 00:50:33,333
Something happened… - Sir, aren’t you here to mourn with us!

1183
00:50:33,333 --> 00:50:35,875
Then why hover around the women’s section!

1184
00:50:37,166 --> 00:50:39,750
Something happened that everyone must know!

1185
00:50:40,583 --> 00:50:42,166
Last night, midnight…

1186
00:50:42,291 --> 00:50:44,291
We were all asleep in the mosquito net when…

1187
00:50:44,416 --> 00:50:46,416
Suddenly we heard shouting.

1188
00:50:46,583 --> 00:50:47,625
Help thief…

1189
00:50:47,708 --> 00:50:48,916
Help thief…

1190
00:50:49,416 --> 00:50:51,541
If someone isn’t here to mourn…

1191
00:50:52,708 --> 00:50:55,833
If someone belongs to another religion… - O dear of Fatemeh…

1192
00:50:55,875 --> 00:50:59,375
If someone is hostile to the faithful… - Don’t come to ruined Kufa.

1193
00:50:59,416 --> 00:51:02,166
Let him go to his own house! - O dear of Fatemeh…

1194
00:51:02,166 --> 00:51:05,000
- Don’t come to ruined Kufa.

1195
00:51:05,041 --> 00:51:07,041
Let him go to his own house!

1196
00:51:07,083 --> 00:51:08,458
- O dear of Fatemeh…

1197
00:51:08,458 --> 00:51:11,666
Let him go to his own house and drink liquor! - Don’t come to ruined Kufa.

1198
00:51:11,708 --> 00:51:14,083
Let him follow his own religion…

1199
00:51:14,125 --> 00:51:15,291
What is this clowning?

1200
00:51:15,333 --> 00:51:17,333
May your eyes go blind!

1201
00:51:19,208 --> 00:51:22,625
- Don’t come to the lane of blood-drinkers.

1202
00:51:23,041 --> 00:51:25,750
- Don’t come to the lane of blood-drinkers.

1203
00:51:27,333 --> 00:51:28,083
Saeid!

1204
00:51:29,375 --> 00:51:31,166
Go tell your mother to come home quickly.

1205
00:51:31,166 --> 00:51:37,208
- The people of Kufa broke their covenant with me…

1206
00:51:37,208 --> 00:51:44,333
- O, I’d give my life for you, don’t come to the lane of blood-drinkers!

1207
00:51:44,375 --> 00:51:47,958
- Don’t come to the lane of blood-drinkers!

1208
00:51:48,083 --> 00:51:51,208
- Don’t come to the lane of blood-drinkers!

1209
00:51:51,458 --> 00:51:58,083
O dear of Fatemeh, don’t come to ruined Kufa!

